 Build the future with us 
 Are you curious, motivated, and skilled at analyzing situations to identify practical solutions? Are you known for your thoroughness, teamwork, and ability to learn quickly? Would you like to expand your knowledge of investments, compliance, and risk management within a leading organization? If so, the Compliance team at iA Global Asset Management (iAGAM) has an opportunity for you.
